    "updated_at": "2023-12-19T05:35:07Z",
    "body": "The normative definition is here: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#top-level-traversable\r\n\r\nThis term isn't really meant to be one for web developers; as with much of the spec, it's used when implementing the internals of a web browser.\r\n\r\nSo, I would not suggest discussing it on web-developer facing documentation.",
