    "updated_at": "2023-12-19T05:44:49Z",
    "body": "> So, I would not suggest discussing it on web-developer facing documentation.\r\n\r\n@domenic Thanks very much for taking the time to respond. We would normally document limits such as not being able to have multiple picture-in-picture windows per browser tab. We'll leave the wording as is though if there is no better way of describing this \"thing\". \r\n\r\n",
